async function sendToCrm(fields){const c=crmConfig();if(!c||!c.formKey)return{ok:true};try{const r=await fetch(`${c.url}/api/leads/in/${c.formKey}`,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({...fields,page:location.href})});const j=await r.json().catch(()=>({}));return r.ok&&j.ok?{ok:true}:{ok:false,error:j.error||'Could not send right now. Please try again.'}}catch{return{ok:false,error:'Could not connect. Check your internet and try again.'}}}
